# Normalize text files to LF in the repository so the project behaves the same
# on Windows, Linux and macOS. Binary assets are detected automatically, but
# list the common ones explicitly for clarity.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pem text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
